        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Omnia AP-9010P, Modern Rectangular Appliance Handle</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Rectangular Appliance Pull is available in 12 or 18 inch lengths. Choose from 6 popular finishes including satin nickel, satin brass, and oil-rubbed bronze. This Modern Rectangular Appliance Handle is a great addition to any kitchen; and since it is made out of solid brass, it can hold up to even vacuum-sealed refrigerators. The Omnia 9010P Refrigerator Pull comes packaged with everything you'll need to install it on an appliance panel. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso see the matching <a href=\"//search?type=product&q=omn-9010\"><b>Rectangular Cabinet Pulls</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Omnia Ultima 9010P Refrigerator Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Pull Mounting: Standard 3/4\" Thick Appliance Panel</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available in 2 Sizes:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<b>AP-9010P/305:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Center to Center Length: 12\" (c.c.)</li>\r\n<li>Total Length: 14\"</li>\r\n<li>Face Width: 3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 2-5/16\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>AP-9010P/457:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Center to Center Length: 18\" (c.c.)</li>\r\n<li>Total Length: 20\"</li>\r\n<li>Face Width: 3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 2-5/16\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/MUL-T-LOCK-C08PC3_size.gif?v=1704354638\" width=\"600\" height=\"144\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Omnia Finishes Diagram\">\r\n</p>",
